{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, then approach object. If object close, take it, process it, then move. If object heavy, call for help. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = CallForHelp    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    />",
